{"4175040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Beyond: Fire & Ice", "steam_appid": 4175040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175040/extras/4f6ac9ac60d2b78a709971c7c4737223.avif?t=1783926681\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175040/extras_big/4f6ac9ac60d2b78a709971c7c4737223.webp?t=1783926681 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beyond: Fire and Ice</strong> is an action-packed RPG set in the mythological world of <strong>Athos</strong>, where ancient gods, elemental powers, and forgotten beasts shape the fate of kingdoms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fragile peace between the <strong>Kingdom of Snowfall</strong> in the North and the <strong>Gulian Empire</strong> in the East is shattered when a mysterious dark force erupts from <strong>Vorrgoth</strong>, the underworld. The Dark Chasm unleashes deadly mimics that frame both nations, plunging the world into a brutal war of Fire and Ice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play as <strong>two protagonists</strong>—<br><strong>Shangdi</strong>, the Emperor of Flames, leading a vast empire forged in volcanic mountains…<br><strong>Skadi</strong>, the dethroned Ice Queen of Snowfall, fighting to reclaim her frozen homeland…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each with clashing beliefs.<br>Each with elemental power.<br>Each unaware that an ancient evil beneath Athos is orchestrating their destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a world inspired by <strong>European and Asian mythology</strong>, filled with frozen peaks, volcanic landscapes, mythical beasts, and legendary dragons. Unravel the truth behind the war, explore ancient ruins, and uncover the secrets of the <strong>Watcher Era</strong> and the creation of the monstrous <strong>Magnaroths</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dual-Protagonist Campaign</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the story from both sides of the conflict. Switch between Shangdi and Skadi as their destinies intertwine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elemental Combat System</strong><br>Master fire and ice through dynamic, combo-based combat.<br>– Summon dragons<br>– Unleash elemental spells<br>– Combine melee, magic, and powerful finishers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175040/extras/c73d3d933f796e6bdd5a963ece4a96e6.poster.avif?t=1783926681\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175040/extras/c73d3d933f796e6bdd5a963ece4a96e6.webm?t=1783926681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175040/extras/c73d3d933f796e6bdd5a963ece4a96e6.mp4?t=1783926681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the Mythical World of Athos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across icy fortresses, snow-covered mountains, lava-filled valleys, and ancient temples shaped by Norse, Chinese, Japanese, and European mythologies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175040/extras/00a6852c27e01f7ccde830323a8b3260.poster.avif?t=1783926681\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175040/extras/00a6852c27e01f7ccde830323a8b3260.webm?t=1783926681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto